==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Duche]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly hard stage for post-EoC players, but nonetheless it is an easy stage, just bring 3-4 meatshields and a couple of ranged attackers, since the Aku Doges have single target you just need to spam the meatshields and attackers to win.

